        <mxCell id="n95" value="&lt;b&gt;Results&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 km height-difference error, processed: DeltaDTM 0.64 / 0.47 m, KLHK 0.67 / 0.49 m (Mendahara / Sugihan-Lumpur); real relief 0.46 / 0.38 m.&lt;br&gt;Pass criterion (written first): Tier A 0.30 m, Tier B half the real relief: nothing passes.&lt;br&gt;Delineation, mean IoU with LiDAR units: DeltaDTM 0.48, KLHK as used then 0.40.&lt;br&gt;Neraca air tier 2: 77 % of cells fixed at canals and edge, so it cannot judge the DTMs yet." style="fontFamily=Source Sans 3;fontColor=#1F2A30;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=6;strokeWidth=1.25;fillColor=#F4F6F6;strokeColor=#B8C4C2;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
